## PROJECT IDENTITY

**Project Name:** NEXORA

**Product Category:** Subscription Management and Revenue Intelligence Platform

**Tagline:** Every Subscription. Every Renewal. Every Revenue Opportunity.

**Project Type:** Full-stack SaaS web application

Act as a senior software architect, full-stack developer, database engineer, financial systems designer, UI/UX designer, and quality assurance engineer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, functional, professional-grade application called **NEXORA – Subscription & Revenue Intelligence Platform**.

NEXORA is designed for SaaS businesses that sell software subscriptions with daily, weekly, monthly, and yearly billing cycles, along with product variants, add-ons, discounts, taxes, and recurring services.

The platform must unify the complete subscription business lifecycle, from product creation and quotations to subscription activation, automated recurring billing, invoice management, payment reconciliation, renewal monitoring, and financial intelligence.

**This must be a genuinely functional application, not just a frontend prototype, static dashboard, or collection of disconnected screens.**

All major modules must communicate with a real backend and MySQL database.

